@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #2d3142
skinparam ArrowColor #4f5d75
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #ececec
skinparam NoteBorderColor #bfc0c0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam activityBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam stateBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam classBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam classBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #2d3142
skinparam circleBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam circleBorderColor #2d3142
title Sequence — Python inference riêng, chưa nối HTTP
actor "CLI / Python caller" as Caller
participant LeafDiseasePredictor as Predictor
participant "PIL / transforms" as Transform
participant ConvNeXtLeafClassifier as Model
participant "torch / label mapping" as Torch
Caller -> Predictor : __init__(checkpoint_path)
Predictor -> Torch : torch.load / normalize_checkpoint_label_mapping
Torch --> Predictor : weights / num_classes / idx_to_info
Predictor -> Model : build_model(pretrained=False)\nload_state_dict / eval
Model --> Predictor : model
Caller -> Predictor : predict_image(image_path, top_k=3)
Predictor -> Transform : Image.open / RGB / transform / batch
Transform --> Predictor : tensor trên device
Predictor -> Model : model(tensor) -> forward(x)
Model --> Predictor : logits
Predictor -> Torch : softmax / topk / idx_to_info
Torch --> Predictor : top probabilities / labels
Predictor --> Caller : plant, disease, confidence (%)\ntop_predictions, image_path
note over Caller,Predictor
HTTP client đòi class_index/class_name/top_k, confidence [0,1].
Chưa có bridge FastAPI trong checkout; không vẽ thành E2E.
end note
@enduml
